                        </ol>


                        <ul>
                            <li>Nhiệm vụ:</li>
                            <li>a) Synthesize information, proposals, and recommendations related to the implementation of JETP, report to the Secretariat implementing JETP (hereinafter referred to as the Secretariat) for the effective implementation of the Political Declaration establishing a Just Energy Transition Partnership in Viet Nam</li>
                            <li>b) Advise the Secretariat to report to competent authorities to resolve and remove difficulties and problems related to the implementation of JETP in Viet Nam for tasks beyond the authority of the Secretariat</li>
                            <li>c) Synthesis monthly evaluation reports of the Working Groups supporting the implementation of JETP and periodic reports of the Secretariat to report to the National Steering Committee for the implementation of Viet Nam’s commitments at COP26;</li>
                            <li>d) Implement the contents related to the General Working Group in the development of the Resource Mobilization Plan (RMP) for the implementation of JETP and monitor and supervise its implementation.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <ul>
                            <li>đ) Prepare contents, documents for meetings of the Secretariat; advise on organizing forums for communicate and discussion between ministries, sectors and international partners in the process of implementing JETP; report to the Head of the Secretariat on the operation of the General Working Group and arising issues that need to be resolved and handled according to their competence;</li>
                            <li>e)  Perform other relevant duties as assigned and directed by the Head of the Secretariat implementing the JETP Declaration.</li>
                        </ul>
