                        <ul class="list-dot list-black">
                            <li>Duties:</li>
                        </ul>

                        <p>Assist the Leader of the Ministry of Planning and Investment in fulfilling the responsibilities of the Secretariat Deputy Head for the implementation of the JETP Declaration and implement the tasks of the Institutional, Policy and Investment Group in the Prime Minister’s Decision No. 845/QD-TTg dated July 14, 2023 establishing the Secretariat for the implementation of the JETP Declaration,&nbsp; the Prime Minister’s Decision No. 1009/QD-TTg dated August 31, 2023 on approving the Scheme for the implementation of the JETP Declaration, specifically:</p>
                        <p>a) Coordinate with the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environment and relevant agencies in formulating and implementing the Resource Mobilization Plan for the implementation of the JETP Declaration. Advising in directing and operating, and handling tasks to implement the Resource Mobilization Plan within the scope of functions and duties of the Ministry of Planning and Investment.</p>
                        <p>b) Mobilize and effectively use funding from partners for Viet Nam’s just energy transition. Identify the need for aid and private investment for just energy transition; mobilize and allocate domestic investment, official development assistance (ODA), concessional loans and non-refundable aid not falling under official development assistance for the implementation of the Scheme implementing JETP Declaration in accordance with regulations on ensuring safety of public debt, national foreign debt.</p>
                        <p>c) Complete institutions, resolve difficulties and obstacles, reform administrative procedures to facilitate for foreign investors and enterprises to participate in the just energy transition. Summarize information, reports, proposals and recommendations to competent authorities in order to facilitate and resolve difficulties and problems related to institutions, policies and investment for the effective implementation of the JETP Declaration, including requesting relevant ministries, sectors, localities, agencies and organizations to provide relevant information. Integrate the just energy transition into the country’s long- and medium-term programs, strategies, master plans, and plans.</p>
                        <p>d) Coordinate closely and regularly with the General Working Group, Technology and Energy Group, Finance Group, International Partners Group (IPG), Glasgow Financial Alliance for Net Zero (GFANZ) and other stakeholders to effectively implement the tasks of the Secretariat for the implementation of the JETP Declaration.</p>
                        <p>e) Organize forums and seminars to discuss with ministries, sectors, localities, the International Partners Group (IPG) and relevant stakeholders; mobilize partners, scientists and consultants in the process of implementing the tasks of the Institutional, Policy and Investment Group.</p>
                        <p>g) Perform other relevant tasks assigned by the Prime Minister – Head of the COP 26 Steering Committee and by the Secretariat implementing the JETP Declaration.</p>
                        <p>&nbsp;</p>
