                        <ul class="mt30">
                            <li>Duties:</li>
                        </ul>

                           <ol>
                            <li>Coordinate with the Ministry of Natural Resources and Environment and agencies to develop Resource Mobilization Plan (RMP) to implement JETP commitments.</li>
                            <li>Develop a work plan with each development partner of International Partners Group (IPG) and foreign lending partners to determine the support capabilities; study international experiences on models and methods of resource mobilization for JETP implementation.</li>
                            <li>Lead and coordinate with relevant agencies to negotiate and receive ODA capital, concessional loans and non-refundable ODA to support energy transition needs according to specialized regulations on management and use of ODA and concessional loans of the International Partners Groups and foreign donors.</li>
                            <li>Lead and coordinate with relevant ministries, sectors and agencies to develop financial mechanisms and policies to encourage the private sector to actively engage in energy transition.</li>
                            <li>Summarize information and report on the implementation of recommendation mobilization related to the implementation of the JETP Resource Mobilization Plan, periodically evaluate the implementation of the plans and roadmaps mentioned in the Resource Mobilization Plan, and propose adjustments (if necessary).</li>
                            <li>&nbsp;Advise in directing and operating the implementation of the Resource Mobilization Plan within the scope of functions and duties of the Ministry of Finance and other tasks assigned by the Head of the Secretariat.</li>
                        </ol>
